   "szLabel": "Line1.1D8BEB",
   "szText": "Farewell. The loom is set, and the weft runs deep.",
   "hLabel": 2456032413
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir1.1D8BEB",
   "szText": "Goodbye with a twinge of sadness. She is leaving ATHRPA and the PLAYER to their doomed fates. ",
   "hLabel": 3801759850
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line3.246535",
   "szText": "Amazons! Attend!",
   "hLabel": 1775661058
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir3.246535",
   "szText": "Commanding. Orders to a group of Amazon guards. It's a small group and they are nearby, so she's projecting but not screaming. ",
